Subject: [PATCH v10 6/8] riscv: add platform-specific double word shifts for riscv32
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 16:44:05 +0300
Message-ID: <20260513134407.884033-7-dmantipov@yandex.ru>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.54.0
